t_data.setup_future_usage</code> is unsupported for this payment method.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.cross_origin_frame_and_browser_not_supported":"Apple Pay is not supported in a cross-origin iframe when the browser (Safari <17) doesn’t allow it or we can’t determine the parent origin.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.domain_unregistered":"The current domain is not registered.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.domain_not_registered":"This payment method requires your domain to be registered in the <pmcLink>Stripe Dashboard</pmcLink>.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.disallowed_by_wallet_config":"This payment method isn’t enabled for your account. You may need to register the domain in your <domainsLink>Stripe Dashboard</domainsLink>. Otherwise, contact <supportLink>Stripe support</supportLink> for assistance. ","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.disallowed_card_brands_present":"<linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> does not show up as an Express Checkout option if Card Brand Filtering is enabled and <code>link</code> is not part of <code>payment_method_types</code>.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.dynamic_payment_methods_capability_not_present":"This payment method is not available to you. If you are connected to a platform, they may need to request access on your behalf.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.dynamic_payment_methods_invalid_buyer_country":"The customer’s country is outside the countries you can accept with this payment method for the provided currency {currency}.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.dynamic_payment_methods_link_without_cards":"You cannot use <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> when cards are disabled in your dashboard.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.dynamic_payment_methods_paypal_unsupported_transaction":"The PayPal payment method does not support the current charge type.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.dynamic_payment_method