ndate_creation_not_supported":"Your account isn’t configured to directly use SetupIntents to create Mandates for Bacs Direct Debits.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.setup_intent_outbound_not_supported_for_type":"This payment method is not supported with the <code>outbound</code> flow_direction. Create a new Setup Intent with payment method type that supports <code>outbound</code> or exclude <code>outbound</code> from flow_directions.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.setup_intent_payment_method_unsupported_type":"This payment method is not supported when using a SetupIntent.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.setup_intent_sepa_generation_sepa_debit_not_enabled":"To confirm a Setup Intent with this payment method type, you must activate SEPA Direct Debit.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.shipping_address_collection_required":"This payment method is not supported when shipping address collection is required.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.shipping_address_provided":"PayPal does not show up as an Express Checkout option when a shipping address is provided.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.shipping_details_update_permission_server_only":"This payment method is not supported with <code>checkout_session[permissions][update_shipping_details]=server_only</code>.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.sole_payment_method":"PayPal does not show up as an Express Checkout option for <code>payment_method_types</code> provided with only <code>paypal</code>.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.sources_maximum_amount":"Amount exceeds the maximum amount for this payment method.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.subscription_mode":"This payment method is not supported when Checkout Session mode is <code>subscription</code>.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.subscription_payment_method_type_is_not_supported_by_adaptive_pricing":"This payment method does not suppport Adaptive Pricing.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.adaptive_pricing_subs_unsupported_integration_currency":"{paymentMethod} doesn’t support the integration currency, which is required for Adaptive Pricing in subscription mode.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.tax_id_collection_required":"This payment method is not supported when tax ID collection is required.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.timeout":"{paymentMethod} request timed out. Try again or check your network connection.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.unsupported_browser":"{paymentMethod} is not supported in this browser.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.unsupported_browser_chromium_edge":"Google Pay is not supported in Edge.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.unsupported_browser_missing_payment_request":"{paymentMethod} requires the PaymentRequest API, which does not exist in this browser.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.unsupported_browser_missing_payment_request_api":"Google Pay is not supported because the browser does not support the Payment Request API (<code>window.PaymentRequest</code> is not available).","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.unsupported_browser_not_chrome_webkit_firefox":"Google Pay is not supported in this browser.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.unsupported_browser_not_safari_or_ios":"Apple Pay is not supported in your browser and/or device.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.unsupported_browser_not_webkit_or_blink":"Google Pay is not supported in this browser.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.unsupported_browser_safari":"The Google Pay button is not supported in Safari.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.usage_not_supported":"{paymentMethod} doesn’t support <code>usage=off_session</code> for SetupIntents or Checkout Sessions in <code>setup</code> mode.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.usage_not_supported_checkout_session":"{paymentMethod} doesn’t support Checkout Sessions in <code>setup</code> mode.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.usage_not_supported_intent":"{paymentMethod} doesn’t support <code>usage=off_session</code> for SetupIntents.","easel.elements_inspector.filtering_messages.wallet_disallowed_from_options":"This wallet is disabled in the wallets config in your Payment Element options.","easel.inbox.create_google_maps_api_key":"Create a Google Maps API key","easel.inbox.heading.error":"Error","easel.inbox.heading.warning":"Warning","easel.inbox.heading.info":"Optimization","easel.inbox.heading.success":"Success","easel.inbox.message.stripe_js_initialization_deferred":"The Stripe.js SDK is required to render the Payment Element and securely collect payment details. For optimal latency, load the script and initialize the Stripe.js constructor early in the user’s session to prevent the script from blocking rendering.","easel.inbox.message.multiple_stripe_js_instances":"Creating multiple instances of the Stripe.js constructor within a single user session can hinder the performance of the Payment Element and your site. If using the same publishable key, create and share a single instance with a singleton pattern. In single-page applications, it is safe and recommended to share the Stripe.js instance across pages.","easel.inbox.message.multiple_elements_instances":"A Payment Element integration uses an Elements instance to manage a group of elements. When using the Payment Element with other elements—such as the Address Element or Express Checkout Element—create all elements within the same Elements instance for optimal performance.","easel.inbox.message.checkout_session_pricing_usage":"Use the amount and currency provided by your Checkout Session when displaying total and line-item prices. This will ensure consistency and proper localization.","easel.inbox.message.dynamic_payment_method":"Use dynamic payment methods to automatically display the most relevant eligible payment methods to each customer to maximize conversion.","easel.inbox.message.embedded_form":"Your current integration may be more complex than it needs to be. Stripe’s <strong>Embedded form</strong> provides Adaptive Pricing, Tax, Stripe Managed Payments and a built-in returning user experience out of the box — with less code than a full custom Elements build.","easel.inbox.message.currency_selector_element":"Add the Currency Selector Element to your page so your international customers will have full control over their choice in currency and payment method.","easel.inbox.no_issues_detected":"No issues detected","easel.inbox.view_docs":"View docs","easel.inbox.quickstart":"Quickstart","easel.inbox.copy_for_llm":"Copy for LLM","easel.inbox.view_migration_guide":"View migration guide","easel.presets.address_element.heading":"Address presets","easel.presets.address_element.all_addresses":"All address presets","easel.presets.address_element.valid_address":"Valid address","easel.presets.address_element.country":"{countryName}","easel.presets.tax_id_element.heading":"Tax ID presets","easel.presets.tax_id_element.valid_tax_id":"Valid tax ID","easel.presets.tax_id_element.invalid_tax_id":"Invalid tax ID","easel.presets.link_authentication_element.valid_email":"Valid email","easel.presets.magic_fill":"Magic fill","easel.presets.magic_fill.description":"Instantly fill all fields in your Elements with valid data.","easel.presets.none.heading":"No presets available","easel.presets.none.description":"Mount Payment Element or Address Element to use presets.","easel.presets.payment_element.heading":"Payment presets","easel.presets.payment_element.other_heading":"Other payment presets","easel.presets.payment_element.all_methods":"All payment methods","easel.presets.payment_element.preset.heading":"{formName} presets","easel.presets.payment_element.preset.displayed_subheading":"Displayed","easel.presets.payment_element.preset.all_button":"All {formName} presets","easel.presets.pa