in":"ZM TIN","tax_id.tax_id_label.zw_tin":"ZW TIN","tax_id.tax_id_label.aw_tin":"AW TIN","tax_id.tax_id_label.az_tin":"AZ TIN","tax_id.tax_id_label.bd_bin":"BD BIN","tax_id.tax_id_label.bj_ifu":"BJ IFU","tax_id.tax_id_label.bf_ifu":"BF IFU","tax_id.tax_id_label.cm_niu":"CM NIU","tax_id.tax_id_label.cv_nif":"CV NIF","tax_id.tax_id_label.et_tin":"ET TIN","tax_id.tax_id_label.kg_tin":"KG TIN","tax_id.tax_id_label.la_tin":"LA TIN","tax_id.tax_id_label.ph_tin":"PH TIN","terms.base.sold_through":"Sold through","terms.text.ap.smp":"By subscribing, you agree to <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>’s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> and <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy> and authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you for the described subscription in {currency} at the displayed exchange rate or the exchange rate at the time of billing until you cancel.","terms.text.ap.smp.cad":"By subscribing, you agree to <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>’s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> and <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy> and authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you for the described subscription in the Canadian dollar equivalent of {amount} at the displayed exchange rate or the exchange rate at the time of billing until you cancel.","terms.text.merchant.payment.both":"Product provided by {businessName} under its <merchantTerms>Terms</merchantTerms> & <merchantPrivacy>Privacy Policy</merchantPrivacy>.","terms.text.merchant.payment.none":"Product provided by {businessName} under its Terms.","terms.text.merchant.payment.pp_only":"Product provided by {businessName} under its Terms and <merchantPrivacy>Privacy Policy</merchantPrivacy>.","terms.text.merchant.payment.tos_only":"Product provided by {businessName} under its <merchantTerms>Terms</merchantTerms>.","terms.text.merchant.subscription.both":"This subscription is provided by {businessName} in accordance with their <merchantTerms>Terms</merchantTerms> and <merchantPrivacy>Privacy Policy</merchantPrivacy>.","terms.text.merchant.subscription.none":"This subscription is provided by {businessName} in accordance with their terms.","terms.text.merchant.subscription.pp_only":"This subscription is provided by {businessName} in accordance with their terms and <merchantPrivacy>Privacy Policy</merchantPrivacy>.","terms.text.merchant.subscription.tos_only":"This subscription is provided by {businessName} in accordance with their <merchantTerms>Terms</merchantTerms>.","terms.text.pm.general.au_becs_debit":"By providing your bank account details and confirming this payment, you agree to this Direct Debit Request and the <directDebitRequestServiceAgreement>Direct Debit Request service agreement</directDebitRequestServiceAgreement> and authorise Stripe Payments Australia Pty Ltd ACN 160 180 343 Direct Debit User ID number 507156 (“Stripe”) to debit your account through the Bulk Electronic Clearing System (BECS) on behalf of {businessName} (the “Merchant”) for payments as per the terms of your agreement with the Merchant. You certify that you are either an account holder or an authorised signatory on the account listed above.","terms.text.pm.general.sepa_sofort":"By providing your payment information and confirming this payment, you authorise (A) {businessName} and Stripe, our payment service provider, to send instructions to your bank to debit your account and (B) your bank to debit your account in accordance with those instructions. As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank under the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited. Your rights are explained in a statement that you can obtain from your bank. You agree to receive notifications for future debits up to 2 days before they occur.","terms.text.pm.general.us_bank_account":"By submitting your order to {businessName} you agree to authorize payments pursuant to <achAuthorizationTerms>these terms</achAuthorizationTerms>.","terms.text.pm.subscription.bancontact":"By providing your payment information and confirming this payment, you authorise (A) {businessName} and Stripe, our payment service provider and/or PPRO, its local service provider, to send instructions to your bank to debit your account and (B) your bank to debit your account in accordance with those instructions. As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank under the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited. Your rights are explained in a statement that you can obtain from your bank. You agree to receive notifications for future debits up to 2 days before they occur.","terms.text.pm.subscription.cashapp":"By continuing, you authorize {businessName} to debit your Cash App account for this payment and future payments in accordance with {businessName}'s terms, until this authorization is revoked. You can change this anytime in your Cash App Settings.","terms.text.pm.subscription.ideal":"By clicking Pay and subscribe, you authorise this payment via iDEAL from your account and also authorise (A) {businessName} and Stripe, our payment service provider, to send instructions to your bank to debit the same account for all future payments under this subscription and (B) your bank to debit the same account for all future payments under this subscription in accordance with those instructions. As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank for all future payments under the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited. Your rights are explained in a statement that you can obtain from your bank. You agree to receive notifications for future debits up to 2 days before they occur.","terms.text.smp.mixed":"By placing your order, you agree to <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>’s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> and <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy> and authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you for this order, including described subscription(s) until you cancel.","terms.text.smp.sepa_payment_mandate":"By paying, you authorise (A) <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to send instructions to your bank to debit your account and (B) your bank to debit your account in accordance with those instructions. As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank under the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited. Your rights are explained in a statement that you can obtain from your bank. You agree to receive notifications for future debits up to 2 days before they occur.","terms.text.smp.sepa_payment":"By paying, you agree to <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>'s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> and <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy> and authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you for this order.","terms.text.smp.sepa_subscription_mandate":"By subscribing you authorise (A) <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to send instructions to your bank to debit your account and (B) your bank to debit your account in accordance with those instructions. As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank under the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited. Your rights are explained in a statement that you can obtain from your bank. You agree to receive notifications for future debits up to 2 days before they occur.","terms.text.smp.sepa_subscription":"By clicking subscribe, you agree to <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>’s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> and <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy> and authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you for the described subscription until you cancel.","terms.text.ap.smp.sepa_subscription":"By clicking subscribe, you agree to <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>’s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> and <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy> and authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you for the described subscription in {currency} at the displayed exchange rate or the exchange rate at the time of billing until you cancel.","terms.text.ap.smp.cad.sepa_subscription":"By clicking subscribe, you agree to <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>’s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> and <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy> and authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you for the described subscription in the Canadian dollar equivalent of {amount} at the displayed exchange rate or the exchange rate at the time of billing until you cancel.","terms.text.smp.bank_authorization":"You agree to authorize payments pursuant to <authorizationTerms>these terms</authorizationTerms>.","terms.text.smp.payment":"By ordering, you authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you and accept <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>’s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> & <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy>.","terms.text.smp.subscription":"By subscribing, you authorize <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to charge you until you cancel and accept <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>’s <linkTerms>Terms</linkTerms> & <linkPrivacy>Privacy Policy</linkPrivacy>.","title.achBankSearchResults":"Bank search results","title.address":"Secure address input frame","title.afterpayClearpayMessage":"Afterpay consumer messaging","title.afterpayClearpayMessageModal":"Afterpay Purchase Terms dialogue","title.auBankAccount":"Secure BECS Direct Debit payment input frame","title.auBankAccountNumber":"Secure BECS Direct Debit account number input frame","title.auBsb":"Secure BECS Direct Debit BSB input frame","title.authentication":"Secure email input frame","title.autocompleteSuggestions":"Google autocomplete suggestions dropdown list","title.card":"Secure card payment input frame","title.cardCvc":"Secure CVC input frame","tit