ssage":"After submitting your order, you will be redirected to a bank transfer details page with instructions to securely complete your purchase.","upe.card_brand.accessibility.current_card":"Current card brand is {brand}.","upe.card_brand.accessibility.supported_cards":"Supported cards include {formattedAndLocalizedListOfCardBrands}.","upe.card_brand.amex":"American Express","upe.card_brand.diners":"Diners Club","upe.card_brand.discover":"Discover","upe.card_brand.elo":"Elo","upe.card_brand.jaywan":"Jaywan","upe.card_brand.jcb":"JCB","upe.card_brand.mastercard":"Mastercard","upe.card_brand.rupay":"RuPay","upe.card_brand.troy":"Troy","upe.card_brand.unionpay":"UnionPay","upe.card_brand.visa":"Visa","upe.card_brand.cartes_bancaires":"Cartes Bancaires","upe.card_brand.link":"<linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>","upe.card_brand.conecs_nit":"Bimpli","upe.card_brand.conecs_sdx":"Pluxee","upe.card_brand.conecs_up":"Up Déjeuner","upe.card_brand.unknown":"Unknown","upe.card_funding.credit":"Credit","upe.card_funding.debit":"Debit","upe.card_funding.prepaid":"Prepaid","upe.cashapp.text_v2":"Cash App Pay selected.","upe.mondu.text_v2":"Mondu selected.","upe.crypto.redirect_message":"You’ll be redirected to complete your purchase.","upe.crypto.text_v2":"Connect your crypto wallet","upe.custom_payment_method.redirect_message":"After submission, you’ll be guided through completing next steps with {externalPaymentMethod}.","upe.customer_balance.text_v2":"Bank transfer selected.","upe.check_scan.text_v2":"Provide a check to the merchant in-person. It will be scanned later to complete your payment.","upe.data.text_v2":"{paymentMethod} selected.","upe.demo_pay.text_v2":"Demo Pay selected.","upe.eps.text_v2":"EPS selected","upe.external_payment_method.redirect_message":"After submission, you will be redirected to {externalPaymentMethod} to complete next steps.","upe.giropay.text_v2":"giropay selected.","upe.gcash.text_v2":"GCash selected.","upe.grabpay.text_v2":"GrabPay selected.","upe.sequr