kBrand>Link</linkBrand> is accepted.","upe.labels.linkOptInWithBrand.v2":"Save my information for faster checkout","upe.labels.mb_way.phone":"Phone number","upe.labels.mobilePhoneNumber":"Mobile number","upe.labels.mobilePhoneNumber.optional":"Mobile number (optional)","upe.labels.more":"More","upe.labels.pay_another_way":"Pay another way","upe.labels.nameOnCard":"Name on card","upe.labels.nz_bank_account.account_holder_name":"Name on account","upe.labels.nz_bank_account.account_holder_name_optional":"This account is in my name","upe.labels.nz_bank_account.account_number":"Account number","upe.labels.nz_bank_account.bank_name":"Name of your bank","upe.labels.nz_bank_account.mandate":"Mandate","upe.labels.nz_bank_account.name":"Your name","upe.labels.paymentMethods":"Payment Methods","upe.labels.rechnung.birthdate":"Birthdate","upe.labels.link_sepa_bank_account.birthdate":"Birthdate","upe.labels.rechnung.phone":"Phone number (optional)","upe.labels.savePayment":"Save payment details for future purchases","upe.labels.savePaymentTo":"Save payment details to {businessName} for future purchases","upe.labels.sepa_debit.iban":"IBAN","upe.labels.setAsDefaultSavedPayment":"Set as default payment method","upe.labels.shippingAsBilling":"Billing is same as shipping information","upe.labels.shippingAsBillingNameOnly":"Billing name is same as shipping name","upe.labels.billingAsShipping":"Shipping is same as billing information","upe.labels.payto.accountNumber":"Account number","upe.labels.payto.bsbNumber":"BSB","upe.labels.payto.payId":"PayID","upe.labels.payto.switchToPayId":"Use PayID instead","upe.labels.payto.switchToBankAccount":"Use BSB and account number instead","upe.labels.pix.taxId":"CPF or CNPJ","upe.labels.progressiveCursor.screenReaderDescription":"While entering card information, you’ll be automatically advanced to the next form field when the current field is complete.","upe.labels.us_bank_account.account_holder_type":"Account holder type","upe.labels.us_bank_account.account_holder_type.business":"Business","upe.labels.us_bank_account.account_holder_type.personal":"Personal","upe.labels.us_bank_account.account_number":"Account number","upe.labels.us_bank_account.account_type":"Account type","upe.labels.us_bank_account.account_type.checking":"Checking","upe.labels.us_bank_account.account_type.savings":"Savings","upe.labels.us_bank_account.confirm_account_number":"Confirm account number","upe.labels.us_bank_account.routing_number":"Routing number","upe.mandates.alipay":"By confirming your payment with Alipay, you allow {businessName} to charge your Alipay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.amazon_pay":"By confirming your payment with AmazonPay, you allow {businessName} to charge your AmazonPay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.aeon_pay":"By confirming your payment with AEON Pay, you allow {businessName} to charge your AEON Pay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.merpay":"By confirming your payment with Merpay, you allow {businessName} to charge your Merpay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.au_pay":"By confirming your payment with au PAY, you allow {businessName} to charge your au PAY account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.dbarai":"By confirming your payment with d-Barai, you allow {businessName} to charge your d-Barai account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.rakuten_pay":"By confirming your payment with Rakuten Pay, you allow {businessName} to charge your Rakuten Pay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.toss_pay":"By confirming your payment with Toss Pay, you allow {businessName} to charge your Toss Pay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.paypay":"By confirming your payment with PayPay, you allow {businessName} to charge your PayPay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.crypto":"By continuing, you allow {businessName} to charge your crypto wallet for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.gcash":"By confirming your payment with GCash, you allow {businessName} to charge your GCash account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.momo":"By confirming your payment with MoMo, you allow {businessName} to charge your MoMo account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.satispay":"By confirming your payment with Satispay, you allow {businessName} to charge your Satispay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.apple_pay":"By continuing, you allow {businessName} to charge your Apple Pay account for this payment and future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.au_becs_debit.anchor":"Direct Debit Request service agreement","upe.mandates.au_becs_debit.part1":"By providing your bank account details and confirming this payment, you agree to this Direct Debit Request and the","upe.mandates.au_becs_debit.part2":"and authorise Stripe Payments Australia Pty Ltd ACN 160 180 343 Direct Debit User ID number 507156 (“Stripe”) to debit your account through the Bulk Electronic Clearing System (BECS) on behalf of {businessName} (the “Merchant”) for payments as per the terms of your agreement with the Merchant. You certify that you are either an account holder or an authorised signatory on the account listed above.","upe.mandates.bacs_debit":"By confirming your payment with Bacs Direct Debit, you allow {businessName} to charge your bank account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.bacs_debit.merchant_sun":"I understand that {sudn} has partnered with Stripe to collect Direct Debits on behalf of {sudn}. I confirm that I am the account holder and only person required to authorise debits from this account.","upe.mandates.bacs_debit.stripe_sun":"I understand that Stripe will be collecting Direct Debits on behalf of {businessName} and confirm that I am the account holder and the only person required to authorise debits from this account.","upe.mandates.pay_by_bank.bacs_debit":"I authorize Stripe to collect this payment and future Direct Debits from my bank account on behalf of {businessName}. I am the account holder and the only person required to authorize debits from this account. I agree to receive 2 days notice via email before any debit.","upe.mandates.boleto":"By confirming your payment with Boleto, you allow {businessName} to charge you for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.card":"By providing your card information, you allow {businessName} to charge your card for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.cardNoBusinessName":"By providing your card information, you allow this merchant to charge your card for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.cashapp":"By continuing, you authorize {businessName} to debit your Cash App account for this payment and future payments in accordance with {businessName}'s terms, until this authorization is revoked. You can change this anytime in your Cash App Settings.","upe.mandates.demo_pay":"By confirming your payment with DemoPay, you allow {businessName} to charge your DemoPay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.google_pay":"By continuing, you allow {businessName} to charge your Google Pay account for this payment and future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.samsung_pay_wallet":"By continuing, you allow {businessName} to charge your Samsung Pay account for this payment and future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.klarna":"By continuing to Klarna, you allow {businessName} to charge your Klarna account for future payments in accordance with their terms and Klarna’s terms. You can change this at any time in your Klarna app or by reaching out to {businessName}.","upe.mandates.linkBankSetupFutureUsage_v2":"By saving your bank account for {businessName} you agree to authorize payments pursuant to","upe.mandates.linkBankSetupFutureUsage_v2_combined":"By saving your bank account for {businessName} you agree to authorize payments pursuant to {linkTerms}.","upe.mandates.linkBank_terms":"these terms","upe.mandates.financial_connections_data_requested_terms.learn_more_link":"Learn more","upe.mandates.financial_connections_data_requested_terms.ownership":"{business_name} can access account and ownership details. {learn_more_link}.","upe.mandates.financial_connections_data_requested_terms.balances":"{business_name} can access account details and balances. {learn_more_link}.","upe.mandates.financial_connections_data_requested_terms.transactions":"{business_name} can access account details and transactions. {learn_more_link}.","upe.mandates.financial_connections_data_requested_terms.ownership_balances":"{business_name} can access account and ownership details and balances. {learn_more_link}.","upe.mandates.financial_connections_data_requested_terms.ownership_transactions":"{business_name} can access account and ownership details and transactions. {learn_more_link}.","upe.mandates.financial_connections_data_requested_terms.balances_transactions":"{business_name} can access account details, balances, and transactions. {learn_more_link}.","upe.mandates.ideal":"By clicking Pay and subscribe, you authorise this payment via iDEAL from your account and also authorise (A) {businessName} and Stripe, our payment service provider, to send instructions to your bank to debit the same account for all future payments under this subscription and (B) your bank to debit the same account for all future payments under this subscription in accordance with those instructions. As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank for all future payments under the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited. Your rights are explained in a statement that you can obtain from your bank. You agree to receive notifications for future debits up to 2 days before they occur.","upe.mandates.financial_connections_data_requested_terms.ownership_balances_transactions":"{business_name} can access account and ownership details, balances, and transactions. {learn_more_link}.","upe.mandates.linkBank_v2":"By submitting your order to {businessName} you agree to authorize payments pursuant to","upe.mandates.linkBank_v2_combined":"By submitting your order to {businessName} you agree to authorize payments pursuant to {linkTerms}.","upe.mandates.kr_card":"By confirming your payment with NICEPAY, you allow {businessName} to charge this payment method for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.kakao_pay":"By confirming your payment with NICEPAY, you allow {businessName} to charge this payment method for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.naver_pay":"By confirming your payment with NICEPAY, you allow {businessName} to charge this payment method for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.kr_market":"By confirming your payment with NICEPAY, you allow {businessName} to charge this payment method for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.nz_bank_account.part1":"By providing your bank account details and confirming this payment, you authorise Stripe New Zealand Limited (authorisation code {directDebitAuthorityNumber}), to debit your account with the amounts of direct debits payable to {businessName} (”Merchant”) in accordance with this authority.","upe.mandates.nz_bank_account.part1_xero":"By providing your bank account details and confirming this payment, you authorise {businessName} (”Merchant”), DDA authorisation code {directDebitAuthorityNumber}, to debit your account with the amounts of direct debits from Merchant in accordance with this authority.","upe.mandates.nz_bank_account.part_1_and_2":"You agree that this authority is subject to both your bank’s terms and conditions that relate to your account and the {direct_debit_service_terms_and_conditions_url}","upe.mandates.nz_bank_account.terms_url_anchor":"Direct Debit Service Terms & Conditions","upe.mandates.nz_bank_account.part3":"You certify that you are either the sole account holder on the bank account listed above or that you are an authorised signatory on, and have authority to operate, this bank account severally.","upe.mandates.nz_bank_account.part4":"We will send you an email confirmation no later than 5 business days after your confirmation of this Direct Debit Authority.","upe.mandates.pay_by_bank_sepa.subscription_authorization":"By subscribing, you authorize {businessName} to charge you according to the terms until you cancel.","upe.mandates.pay_by_bank_sepa.debit_authorization":"You also authorize Stripe to collect payments from your bank account on behalf of {businessName}, including Direct Debits for future payments.","upe.mandates.pay_by_bank_sepa.refund_entitlement":"You are entitled to a refund from your bank for future payments under the bank’s terms.","upe.mandates.pay_by_bank_sepa.refund_period":"Refunds must be claimed within 8 weeks of the debit date. Your bank can provide a statement explaining your rights.","upe.mandates.paypal":"By confirming your payment with PayPal, you allow {businessName} to charge your PayPal account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.payto":"By confirming your payment with PayTo, you allow {businessName} to charge your bank account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.pix":"By confirming your payment with Pix, you allow {businessName} to charge this payment method for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.revolut_pay":"By confirming your payment with RevolutPay, you allow {businessName} to charge your RevolutPay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.sepa":"By providing your payment information and confirming this payment, you authorise (A) {businessName} and Stripe, our payment service provider and/or PPRO, its local service provider, to send instructions to your bank to debit your account and (B) your bank to debit your account in accordance with those instructions. As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank under the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited. Your rights are explained in a statement that you can obtain from your bank. You agree to receive notifications for future debits up to 2 days before they occur.","upe.mandates.sepa.citi":"By providing your payment information and confirming this payment, you authorise (A) {businessName} and Stripe, our payment service provider, to send instructions to your bank to debit your account and (B) your bank to debit your account in accordance with those instructions. As part of your rights, you are entitled to a refund from your bank under the terms and conditions of your agreement with your bank. A refund must be claimed within 8 weeks starting from the date on which your account was debited. Your rights are explained in a statement that you can obtain from your bank. You agree to receive notifications for future debits up to 2 days before they occur.","upe.mandates.sepa_debit.setup_future_usage":"By confirming your payment with SEPA Debit, you allow {businessName} to charge this payment method for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.setup_future_usage.on_session":"By confirming your payment, you allow {businessName} to charge you for this payment and save your payment information in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.setup_future_usage.off_session":"By confirming your payment, you allow {businessName} to charge you for this payment and future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.twint":"By confirming your payment with TWINT, you allow {businessName} to charge your TWINT account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.touch_n_go":"By confirming your payment with Touch 'n Go, you allow {businessName} to charge your Touch 'n Go account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.truemoney":"By confirming your payment with TrueMoney, you allow {businessName} to charge your TrueMoney account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.vipps":"By confirming your payment with Vipps, you allow {businessName} to charge your Vipps account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.wechat_pay":"By confirming your payment with WeChat Pay, you allow {businessName} to charge your WeChat Pay account for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.upi":"By confirming your payment with UPI, you allow {businessName} to charge this payment method for future payments in accordance with their terms.","upe.mandates.us_bank_account.mandate_terms_link":"these terms","upe.mandates.us_bank_account.microdeposits":"You will see a $0.01 deposit in your account in 1-2 business days. Then you’ll get an email with instructions to complete payment to {businessName}.","upe.mandates.us_bank_account.microdeposits.setup":"You will see a $0.01 deposit in your account in 1-2 business days. Then you’ll get an email with instructions to complete set up with {businessName}.","upe.mandates.us_bank_account.setupFutureUsageV2":"By saving your bank account for {businessName} you agree to authorize payments pursuant to","upe.mandates.us_bank_account.setupFutureUsageV2_combined":"By saving your bank account for {businessName} you agree to authorize payments pursuant to {terms}.","upe.mandates.us_bank_accountV2"