 and payment apps such as KBank, SCB, Bangkok Bank, Krunthai Bank and Krungsri.","upe.qr_code_scan_text.cashapp":"You will be shown a QR code to scan using Cash App.","upe.qr_code_scan_text.paynow":"You will be shown a QR code to scan using your preferred banking or payment app.","upe.qr_code_scan_text.promptpay":"You will be shown a QR code to scan using your mobile banking app.","upe.qr_code_scan_text.swish":"You’ll be asked to redirect to your Swish app or scan a QR code with your Swish app and verify your identity with BankID.","upe.qr_code_scan_text.upi":"You will be shown a QR code to scan using your preferred payment app.","upe.qr_code_scan_text.wechat_pay":"You will be shown a QR code to scan using WeChat Pay.","upe.rechnung.instructions":"The invoice amount is due 14 days after the shipping confirmation email is sent.","upe.rechnung.legal_text":"By choosing to pay on invoice, you agree to the <paymentTermsLink>supplementary terms of payment</paymentTermsLink> and the undertaking of risk assessment. You also agree that your information (such as address, name and date of birth) will be shared in accordance with the <dataProtectionLink>supplementary data protection information</dataProtectionLink>.","upe.redirectMessage_v2":"After submission, you will be redirected to securely complete next steps.","upe.redirectMessage.ng_wallet.terms_link":"terms","upe.redirectMessage.ng_wallet":"By confirming your payment, you agree that your transaction will be handled by Global Stack Services Limited as merchant of record and in accordance with their {terms_link}.","upe.redirectMessage.kr_card":"After submission, you will be redirected to NICEPAY to select your card issuer and complete the transaction securely. NICEPAY will process the transaction per its {terms_link} in Korean Won, without currency conversion or FX fees from your card provider.","upe.redirectMessage.kr_card.link_text":"terms of use","upe.redirectMessage.kakao_pay":"After submission, you will be redirected to Kakao Pay to securely complete next steps. This transaction will be processed via NICEPAY in accordance with NICEPAY’s {terms_link}.","upe.redirectMessage.kakao_pay.link_text":"terms of use","upe.redirectMessage.naver_pay":"After submission, you will be redirected to Naver Pay to securely complete next steps. This transaction will be processed via NICEPAY in accordance with NICEPAY’s {terms_link}.","upe.redirectMessage.naver_pay.link_text":"terms of use","upe.redirectMessage.nigeria_paystack":"By confirming your payment, you agree that your transaction will be handled by Global Stack Services Limited as merchant of record and in accordance with their {terms_link}.","upe.redirectMessage.nigeria_paystack.link_text":"terms of use","upe.redirectMessage.payco":"After submission, you will be redirected to PAYCO to securely complete next steps. This transaction will be processed via NICEPAY in accordance with NICEPAY’s {terms_link}.","upe.redirectMessage.payco.link_text":"terms of use","upe.redirectMessage.samsung_pay":"After submission, you will be redirected to Samsung Pay to securely complete next steps. This transaction will be processed via NICEPAY in accordance with NICEPAY’s {terms_link}.","upe.redirectMessage.samsung_pay.link_text":"terms of use","upe.revolut_pay.text_v2":"Revolut Pay selected.","upe.qris.text_v2":"Complete checkout to pay with QRIS.","upe.shopeepay.text_v2":"Complete checkout to pay with ShopeePay.","upe.gopay.text_v2":"Complete checkout to pay with GoPay.","upe.momo.text_v2":"Complete checkout to pay with MoMo.","upe.saved.accessibility.expand":"Show more payment methods.","upe.saved.accessibility.expand_and_manage":"Show more payment methods and options to edit or remove saved methods.","upe.saved.accessibility.selected":"Selected payment method.","upe.saved.cvc_recollect":"For security, please re-enter your card’s security code.","upe.saved_card.brand_and_last4":"{cardBrand} •••• {cardLast4}","upe.saved.errors.confirm":"Your card has been d